Module 9 - AI Feature Proposal
AI Feature
One AI-powered feature for this application would be a Student Performance Analyzer.
The AI system would analyze student scores and identify students who may need additional academic support.
Data Needed
Student ID
Student Name
Student Score
Historical grade records
What the User Would See
After entering student scores, the user could receive recommendations such as:
Student: John Smith
Score: 58
AI Recommendation: This student may be at risk of failing and may benefit from tutoring or additional study support.
Application Architecture
User Input
↓
Student Grade Tracker
↓
AI Analysis Module
↓
Performance Recommendation
↓
Display Results to User
Prototype Version
If a live AI service is unavailable, the application could simulate AI recommendations using score ranges:
90–100: Excellent Performance
70–89: Satisfactory Performance
Below 70: Additional Support Recommended
This prototype demonstrates how AI could be integrated into the application in the future.
